	<key>readme</key>
	<string># Flowmodoro

A flow-based productivity timer which counts up instead of down, but still gives you breaks with the Pomodoro ratio (work time divided by 5). Automatically toggles Do Not Disturb on/off, logs work blocks to a calendar of your choice, and has the ability to toggle and change MacOS Background Sounds.</string>
